# Compiles an hscript-family library with source position tracking on.
#
# Without this define hscript's `Expr` is `typedef ExprDef = Expr`, so it records no positions at all,
# and its token pushback holds bare tokens rather than {min, max, t}. This fork always tracks
# positions, because error reporting and call-stack traces depend on them, so the default build is
# not a like-for-like comparison. See docs/benchmarks.md.
-D hscriptPos
